'''Aldrassil''' is the giant tree at the center of [[Shadowglen]], which is located in the northeastern corner of [[Teldrassil]].

The leader of Shadowglen, [[Tenaron Stormgrip]], makes his home at the very top of Aldrassil.

It has [[class]] trainers for all [[night elf]] classes, although the spells available are capped at level 6. 


== Questgivers ==
* [[Gilshalan Windwalker]] - [[Quest:Tenaron's Summons]], [[Quest:Webwood Egg]], [[Quest:Webwood Venom]]
* [[Melithar Staghelm]] - [[Quest:The Woodland Protector]]
* [[Shanda]] - [[Quest:In Favor of Elune]] (Priest)
* [[Tenaron Stormgrip]] - [[Quest:Crown of the Earth]]

See [[Shadowglen]] for quest givers in the area immediately surrounding Aldrassil.<br>
See also <b>[http://www.goblinworkshop.com/areas/Shadowquest/quests.html Quests in Shadowglen]</b>


